name algolrevived
category Package
revision 56864
shortdesc A revival of Frutiger's Algol alphabet
longdesc The package revives Frutiger's Algol alphabet, designed in 1963
longdesc for the code segments in an ALGOL manual. OpenType and type1,
longdesc regular and medium weights, upright and slanted. Not
longdesc monospaced, but good for listings if you don't need code to be
longdesc aligned with specific columns. It also makes a passable but
longdesc limited text font.
